Hello,

I am trying to setup a AR9374 based USB WiFi as AP. I am using the 
latest git (3.13-rc8) from: https://github.com/kvalo/ath and hostapd 
v2.0. My client is able to associate with the AR9374 AP but I am unable 
to ping it. I used wireshark to observe the ping from AR9374 to client. 
I have attached the wireshark captures.

1) gemicomlinux.pcapng
This contains the Wireshark observation at the AP (AR9374). The ping was 
done from AP to client. We can see the ping broadcast but no ICMP request.

2) intelclient_gemicomAP.pcapng
This contains the Wireshark observation on the client side. The client 
is able to see the the broadcast message from AR9374 and replies with 
its MAC address.

Why is the ICMP request not sent from the AR9374?

Regards,

Pannir

